# Spell levels (feat_spell_levels.py): Lucia at level 12 (index 11 at 0x020B46C0) opens
# Special in the first temple battle after Jian Fights; the list shows the spells learned by then:
# Healing Water, Tender Rain, Cure Squall, and Divine Rain (Miracle Tears comes at 13). Shots spells_lv12 and, after Down, spells_lv12_down. Run with --save.
include party2_strong
pin u32 0x020b46c0 11
wait 270
press A 8
wait 50
press A 8
wait 60
press A 8
wait 60
press Right 8
wait 50
press A 8
wait 60
shot spells_lv12
press Down 8
wait 30
shot spells_lv12_down
